"Let visitors leave their email on an out-of-stock product and be told when "
"it is available again. Turning this off hides the form, refuses "
"subscriptions and stops the restock sweep for this website; existing rows "
"are kept."
msgstr ""
"允许访客在缺货产品上留下电子邮箱，并在产品\n"
"恢复库存时收到通知。关闭后，将隐藏该表单、\n"
"拒绝订阅，并停止此网站的补货扫描；已有的记录\n"
"会保留。"

